  <DocumentLink id="365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" target-id="SD:d073d100-bbb9-5d91-9686-157643612e4a" type="Default" />
  <Item id="3339089a-8164-5857-bf7f-37b123e0705e" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSC-000</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+40%">Technical Safety Concept — Rear PTO</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph>Technical safety requirements per ISO 25119-3:2018, Clause 5. Each TSR cross-references the functional safety requirement(s) it refines; states, times and safe-state transitions are specified per 5.4.2.2.2.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="061af36f-d5e5-5ad1-9d45-6f46d2350474" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>
          <Text bold="true" font-size="+16%">1. States and times (5.4.2.2.2)</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph alignment="Center"><Image width="980.00" height="520.00"></Image></Paragraph>
        <Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text italic="true">Figure 1 — operating states of the PTO control; the safe state is reachable from every state</Text></Paragraph>
        <Paragraph alignment="Center"><Image width="980.00" height="330.00"></Image></Paragraph>
        <Paragraph alignment="Center"><Text italic="true">Figure 2 — stop-chain response-time budget; validated worst case 316 ms</Text></Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>—</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="a80c6cef-3adf-595f-8281-784a8e4d42e4" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-001</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Cab engage command validity: NO contact closed AND NC contact open, both transitions inside a 50 ms window; any other pattern for &gt; 100 ms raises DTC C1101 and inhibits engagement.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-001</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="55752b41-83a1-5788-a39b-84b2eed0ac1b" target-id="SDI:20bbce62-d02a-5120-be38-011adaeea9b8" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="20c14f5c-9768-58a3-a3c2-564915385b24" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-002</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Valve energisation requires L1 PWM active AND L2 enable conducting (series O1·O2). Each MCU shall be able to reach the safe state alone by opening its own switch.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-002, -005</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="a90d5c84-5ae3-5e04-80da-9cfac52d4a83" target-id="SDI:bae9acc9-c473-515a-8a83-a3ea36d620b0" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="989b7a4d-4006-5118-8202-ecaa2cb1191d" target-id="SDI:cc0eadcb-6e74-5e63-af70-82e30a4df870" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="60a9b0be-bfa7-5624-9762-ea7f98724c45" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-003</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Valve current shall be inside the command-dependent window (off: &lt; 50 mA; hold: 380–700 mA) within 30 ms of every command change; violation triggers the stop chain (D1).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="98ca8906-a96a-5d29-8b1b-6a8328c75694" target-id="SDI:f79ddebf-183c-59e9-9e4a-0dbb554cf975" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="129f9ffb-f8e8-5d04-a420-dba1a4209c23" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Start interlock: on power-up both MCUs run BIST (RAM march, flash CRC, output pull-in test below clutch-fill pressure); outputs stay disabled until both report PASS and the engage command is absent.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-003</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="6c30a53d-d8d6-5d6b-a0e6-50cf4fd8cf96" target-id="SDI:84c6b327-c219-50b2-b9f7-73fd77db05e8" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="9f0356ad-2358-57c1-9ccf-b82503570e8a" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-005</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>The engage state machine shall power up in OFF; the engaged state shall not be persisted (no NVM latch of engagement; parameter area write-protected in operation).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-007</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="29f47914-1f21-53cc-abe2-ad2787d04b3e" target-id="SDI:95ea2f41-daea-5622-82c4-0396c29a90c6" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="8c3a15ac-daf4-5fbc-a5e4-47a593b66f96" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-006</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Stop-chain timing allocation: detection ≤ 40 ms (2 application cycles), output de-energise ≤ 20 ms, clutch pressure &lt; touch point ≤ 240 ms, brake engaged ≤ 100 ms. Budget Σ ≤ 400 ms; validated with cold oil (−25 °C).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-006</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="b70f604d-795f-5bdc-8f69-5d133ee04463" target-id="SDI:8d659430-6f5e-535c-b03d-3f4933f6439b" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="f9fdda9c-5e66-5f5c-adb6-ae3f522fbc74" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-007</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Operator-presence processing: two seat-switch contacts sampled at 10 ms; disagreement &gt; 500 ms = presence fault (inhibit new engagement, warning). Presence loss &gt; 0.6 s in mobile mode triggers the stop chain. Stationary mode requires: PTO speed ≤ 540 mode, park brake applied, deliberate enable.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-008</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="2" />
    <ElementLink id="b0b6d298-9ced-5f0d-b1df-8eba00b9e06c" target-id="SDI:51b027c1-fd32-5146-b3ec-52f18affd6af" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="0f622acb-5b36-597a-b22d-8d62ce38e459" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-008</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Fender jog: accepted only in state OFF with cab switch OFF; output limited to jog pulses (creep ≤ 20 rpm); release or 10 s timeout stops within 200 ms; stuck-button (no release edge after jog end) inhibits further external engagement (DTC C1108).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-009, -010</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="96c880f8-9ce1-58b6-8fb1-53ca67662530" target-id="SDI:ff80e3ee-c51c-50d4-9a41-1c390c914d57" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="24aadd9b-fb0e-5efc-aa68-e7e7def49b06" target-id="SDI:169d4fd3-ae08-5d30-9c87-5c54b2df9e2e" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="aae2fe37-86f4-5ba7-aa8b-57290747beb0" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-009</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Speed-mode supervision: coded lever position vs measured n_ENG/n_PTO ratio; mismatch &gt; 500 ms inhibits engagement (standstill) or triggers DM-2 (running).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-011, -012</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="65c20fbf-f593-599e-b052-e52bc43405d4" target-id="SDI:a05a9889-02c9-52bf-950b-59af5c27ffa8" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="6e56102b-4c3c-5e8a-8943-bb1a0d3da505" target-id="SDI:e5b04a24-3d18-5c50-8411-90e2799936d8" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="86d1f2c8-08d9-5b12-83d7-2d86488f85b3" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-010</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Shaft-speed supervision: n_PTO &gt; 1.10 × mode nominal for &gt; 300 ms triggers DM-2 controlled disengage (ramp-down ≤ 1 s) and warning.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-011</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="bb24c779-baf7-55f0-bb5f-3acc011caf4b" target-id="SDI:a05a9889-02c9-52bf-950b-59af5c27ffa8" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="61800c3b-3982-5bd6-8939-7630628420e6" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-011</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Engagement ramp: closed-loop current ramp 0 → hold in ≤ 2.0 s; slip (n_PTO vs expected) supervised; ramp abort on stall or overcurrent.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-013</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="f6c03fb0-67be-5ae5-a5fd-09bdcfa2e568" target-id="SDI:0a20f3af-a3d3-5c0b-a99f-f70701b2dacd" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="77b5840b-9405-5352-b069-addb89043a46" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-012</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Cross-monitoring: SPI question-answer every 20 ms with 16 pre-computed challenges; two consecutive misses = channel fault → safe state (D4). External window watchdog (U6) supervises L1 with 25–75 ms window; L2 has an independent internal WD.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-002, -004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="e25a2e4f-9fc0-5896-a8a8-50e972c87658" target-id="SDI:bae9acc9-c473-515a-8a83-a3ea36d620b0" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="e7aeba48-14ed-591a-9324-096b376b3c74" target-id="SDI:f79ddebf-183c-59e9-9e4a-0dbb554cf975" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="ee8e6bc2-e9b2-5ad4-b3ca-875232e4d1da" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-013</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Supply supervision: 5 V / 3.3 V window monitors reset both MCUs outside 4.5–5.5 V / 3.0–3.6 V; the output stage is disabled during reset and brown-out (outputs pulled to safe by hardware).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="131f14a9-592c-5c5f-9ef3-81739f5074ab" target-id="SDI:f79ddebf-183c-59e9-9e4a-0dbb554cf975" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="a03f088f-f318-5232-b0c5-a1ea1b65dcf5" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-014</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Environmental withstand: ISO 15003 cab class (−25…+70 °C, 5 g vibration), ISO 7637-2 pulses 1/2a/3/5a (clamped load dump), ISO 14982 EMC, reverse polarity −14 V, IP54 connector zone.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="4" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="1" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>all</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="dad7ac68-3f46-5986-955d-47bfd74f94bb" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-015</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Manual reset per Annex F.4: after a latched safe state, recovery requires fault absence AND cab switch to OFF AND a deliberate reset action (switch held OFF 2 s); reset shall not start motion by itself.</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="3" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-004</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="972492cb-d42e-5d61-9bbe-fa43ef16f5ba" target-id="SDI:f79ddebf-183c-59e9-9e4a-0dbb554cf975" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="3ce029f2-7f56-5f43-93d3-8ff86a253f18" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-016</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>An overspeed reaction shall use the controlled disengage ramp (not an instantaneous cut) unless a second, higher-priority stop demand is present; abrupt full-load cuts are themselves a driveline hazard (PTO-HZ-08).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="2" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-011, -013</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
    <ElementLink id="2e577081-d86e-5245-a16f-5c615362ebca" target-id="SDI:a05a9889-02c9-52bf-950b-59af5c27ffa8" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
    <ElementLink id="00f5afa7-e785-55c8-8b42-94e6096365a4" target-id="SDI:0a20f3af-a3d3-5c0b-a99f-f70701b2dacd" doc-link-id="CDL:365b03f2-e7da-5b9a-a361-738ff53e49a2" type="Default" />
  </Item>
  <Item id="d0d5ae9b-dfc3-5f2f-b809-79e8a24503cf" type="Default">
    <Attribute name="ReqID">
      <Value>PTO-TSR-017</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Contents">
      <Value>
        <Paragraph>Indication: PTO state and warnings on CAN with alive counter + checksum; loss of indication shall not affect any safety function (QM path, PTO-FSR-014).</Paragraph>
      </Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Type" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="AgPL" value="0" />
    <Attribute name="Allocation" value="5" />
    <Attribute name="Refines">
      <Value>PTO-FSR-014</Value>
    </Attribute>
    <Attribute name="Status" value="4" />
